Remember the goal: everything should be reproducable. It should be easy to reset the dev environment to a known good state. Each workflow should be tested, because we keep getting bugs that are fixed on one workflow/driver reproduce on another. Generalize fully each defect. Prefer good architure that makes bugs impossible over fiddly hacks, and use 3rd-party tools / libraries whenever you can. Whenever it is possible to upstream something, call it out.

